# AGENTS.md is TRACKED on purpose — it carries the owner's standing
# instructions and has to survive a fresh clone. `next dev` doesn't replace it:
# it upserts only its own block between the nextjs-agent-rules markers (see
# node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js), so hand-written
# content around that block is safe. Commit the block with your work.
/CLAUDE.md
